            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ad4aed03945bc5eb75b58a534a4b156a.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=920 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ad4aed03945bc5eb75b58a534a4b156a.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ad4aed03945bc5eb75b58a534a4b156a.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Um jogo de estratégia e sobrevivência em que a última frota da humanidade deriva pelas ruínas da civilização, perseguindo um mito entre as estrelas.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Um salto falhado. Um portal colapsado. Silêncio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acordas no espaço profundo. À deriva, sozinho e longe de qualquer sistema conhecido. A civilização desapareceu. A frota que comandas pode ser tudo o que resta da humanidade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O oxigénio está no limite. Os sistemas estão a falhar.</strong> Não haverá reforços nem vais reinventar nada — apenas o que levas contigo e o que conseguires recuperar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tua missão é clara: <strong>adaptar-te, resistir e encontrar o sistema mítico conhecido apenas como ETERNITY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/21b244db1715bfe5dcd752942d9e79a6.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/21b244db1715bfe5dcd752942d9e79a6.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/21b244db1715bfe5dcd752942d9e79a6.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navega por um mapa estelar gerado proceduralmente, onde cada sessão é diferente. Descobre mundos sem vida, estações abandonadas, anomalias estranhas e postos avançados há muito extintos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faz varreduras, realiza levantamentos e decide: arriscar uma exploração mais profunda ou jogar pelo seguro para sobreviver a mais um ciclo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/eac597605aa69e5ee8983055e662863b.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/eac597605aa69e5ee8983055e662863b.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/eac597605aa69e5ee8983055e662863b.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cada recurso conta. Equilibra oxigénio, água, comida e energia entre várias naves — cada uma é um ativo vital e insubstituível.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quando uma nave falha, as outras sofrem. Quando um sistema colapsa, toda a frota treme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Um único descuido pode desencadear uma catástrofe em cadeia.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/096547619ffefc1e9a23ae8225022df6.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/096547619ffefc1e9a23ae8225022df6.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/096547619ffefc1e9a23ae8225022df6.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não chegarão novas naves. Adapta o que tens. Aproveita o que encontrares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atribui funções, transfere carga, refaz a cablagem dos cascos: plataformas de mineração, plataformas de sensores, corvetas de defesa, fazendas móveis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cada nave torna-se o que a frota precisa… até ao dia em que cede.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/d00d3940b6826eec6cf9f556547c9c96.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/d00d3940b6826eec6cf9f556547c9c96.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/d00d3940b6826eec6cf9f556547c9c96.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Os teus sobreviventes são mais do que números: são humanos frágeis e desesperados.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chamas solares, falhas de sistemas, motins e dilemas morais põem à prova a tua liderança.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promulga leis. Impõe disciplina — ou arrisca um colapso a partir de dentro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0de667ff75713571acd82a5a8a4b799e.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0de667ff75713571acd82a5a8a4b799e.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0de667ff75713571acd82a5a8a4b799e.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nem todos os remanescentes da humanidade são amigáveis. Piratas, IAs descontroladas e fações despedaçadas espreitam nas sombras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entra em combates nave-a-nave desesperados, repele ações de abordagem e sacrifica o que for preciso para sobreviver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/f75ddb9fbb86eedba01fadf278c43200.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/f75ddb9fbb86eedba01fadf278c43200.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/f75ddb9fbb86eedba01fadf278c43200.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O que destruiu a rede galáctica? Porque é que a galáxia ficou em silêncio?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recupera fragmentos de dados, transmissões assombradas e registos enterrados para recompor o que aconteceu após o salto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fim está <i>ETERNITY</i> e, com ela, a verdade… ou o esquecimento.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b62b94d44ddcc94ad77596692eb24b6e.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b62b94d44ddcc94ad77596692eb24b6e.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b62b94d44ddcc94ad77596692eb24b6e.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sobrevivência estratégica e sistémica</strong>: todos os recursos estão interligados. Qualquer sistema pode falhar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frota insubstituível</strong>: as naves são raras. Personaliza o que tens, esforça-te por recuperar cascos abandonados — ou vê-los arder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galáxia gerada proceduralmente</strong>: novas sessões, novos desafios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eventos e escolhas reativas</strong>: agitação da tripulação, tempestades de erupções solares, sabotagem e decisões morais.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistério narrativo</strong>: descobre o que levou ao fim da humanidade e o que existe para lá disso.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combate tático</strong>: ferramentas limitadas. Tudo em jogo. Sem segundas oportunidades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rejogabilidade através de narrativa emergente</strong>: cada partida conta uma história diferente de falha, resiliência ou triunfo.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ad4aed03945bc5eb75b58a534a4b156a.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=920 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ad4aed03945bc5eb75b58a534a4b156a.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ad4aed03945bc5eb75b58a534a4b156a.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=800 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b16918fb0e05babd6274bd080202c2b5.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Um jogo de estratégia e sobrevivência em que a última frota da humanidade deriva pelas ruínas da civilização, perseguindo um mito entre as estrelas.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Um salto falhado. Um portal colapsado. Silêncio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/edcc3d2903f5cb149ee6a3311d907c08.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acordas no espaço profundo. À deriva, sozinho e longe de qualquer sistema conhecido. A civilização desapareceu. A frota que comandas pode ser tudo o que resta da humanidade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>O oxigénio está no limite. Os sistemas estão a falhar.</strong> Não haverá reforços nem vais reinventar nada — apenas o que levas contigo e o que conseguires recuperar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tua missão é clara: <strong>adaptar-te, resistir e encontrar o sistema mítico conhecido apenas como ETERNITY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/21b244db1715bfe5dcd752942d9e79a6.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/21b244db1715bfe5dcd752942d9e79a6.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/21b244db1715bfe5dcd752942d9e79a6.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navega por um mapa estelar gerado proceduralmente, onde cada sessão é diferente. Descobre mundos sem vida, estações abandonadas, anomalias estranhas e postos avançados há muito extintos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/76125440de78d551419922087d927695.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faz varreduras, realiza levantamentos e decide: arriscar uma exploração mais profunda ou jogar pelo seguro para sobreviver a mais um ciclo?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/eac597605aa69e5ee8983055e662863b.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/eac597605aa69e5ee8983055e662863b.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/eac597605aa69e5ee8983055e662863b.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cada recurso conta. Equilibra oxigénio, água, comida e energia entre várias naves — cada uma é um ativo vital e insubstituível.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/ea3c6d30f07213d32fd407ce58eb3b35.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quando uma nave falha, as outras sofrem. Quando um sistema colapsa, toda a frota treme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Um único descuido pode desencadear uma catástrofe em cadeia.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/096547619ffefc1e9a23ae8225022df6.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/096547619ffefc1e9a23ae8225022df6.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/096547619ffefc1e9a23ae8225022df6.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Não chegarão novas naves. Adapta o que tens. Aproveita o que encontrares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/a04f0ddacc9cf0782a8ae611ee206363.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atribui funções, transfere carga, refaz a cablagem dos cascos: plataformas de mineração, plataformas de sensores, corvetas de defesa, fazendas móveis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cada nave torna-se o que a frota precisa… até ao dia em que cede.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/d00d3940b6826eec6cf9f556547c9c96.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/d00d3940b6826eec6cf9f556547c9c96.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/d00d3940b6826eec6cf9f556547c9c96.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Os teus sobreviventes são mais do que números: são humanos frágeis e desesperados.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chamas solares, falhas de sistemas, motins e dilemas morais põem à prova a tua liderança.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/74f3d9956e72e6c3e4f104564d759dda.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promulga leis. Impõe disciplina — ou arrisca um colapso a partir de dentro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0de667ff75713571acd82a5a8a4b799e.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0de667ff75713571acd82a5a8a4b799e.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/0de667ff75713571acd82a5a8a4b799e.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nem todos os remanescentes da humanidade são amigáveis. Piratas, IAs descontroladas e fações despedaçadas espreitam nas sombras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/68a8e910f141b2bbb478712ad0ceaff7.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entra em combates nave-a-nave desesperados, repele ações de abordagem e sacrifica o que for preciso para sobreviver.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/f75ddb9fbb86eedba01fadf278c43200.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/f75ddb9fbb86eedba01fadf278c43200.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/f75ddb9fbb86eedba01fadf278c43200.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O que destruiu a rede galáctica? Porque é que a galáxia ficou em silêncio?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recupera fragmentos de dados, transmissões assombradas e registos enterrados para recompor o que aconteceu após o salto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No fim está <i>ETERNITY</i> e, com ela, a verdade… ou o esquecimento.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b62b94d44ddcc94ad77596692eb24b6e.poster.avif?t=1783589488\" width=1170 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b62b94d44ddcc94ad77596692eb24b6e.webm?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/391670/extras/b62b94d44ddcc94ad77596692eb24b6e.mp4?t=1783589488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sobrevivência estratégica e sistémica</strong>: todos os recursos estão interligados. Qualquer sistema pode falhar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frota insubstituível</strong>: as naves são raras. Personaliza o que tens, esforça-te por recuperar cascos abandonados — ou vê-los arder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galáxia gerada proceduralmente</strong>: novas sessões, novos desafios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eventos e escolhas reativas</strong>: agitação da tripulação, tempestades de erupções solares, sabotagem e decisões morais.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistério narrativo</strong>: descobre o que levou ao fim da humanidade e o que existe para lá disso.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combate tático</strong>: ferramentas limitadas. Tudo em jogo. Sem segundas oportunidades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rejogabilidade através de narrativa emergente</strong>: cada partida conta uma história diferente de falha, resiliência ou triunfo.</p>",
            "short_description": "Lidera a última frota da humanidade através de um sistema estelar abandonado. Raciona o suporte de vida, pondera entre investigação e sobrevivência e molda a sociedade com decisões do Conselho da Frota que não poderás desfazer. Cada escolha aperta o caminho até ao próximo salto.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong>, Francês, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Japonês, Coreano, Português (Brasil), Português (Portugal), Chinês simplificado, Espanhol (América Latina), Russo<br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
